      <div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-amber-200 bg-amber-50 p-4 text-sm text-amber-950"><strong>Subasta de práctica:</strong> el contador y las pujas solo cambian en tu navegador. No hay confirmación en servidor ni compromisos de compra.</div><section class="mt-4 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2">{#each auctions as auction (auction.id)}<article class="rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm"><div class="flex justify-between"><span class="rounded-full bg-rose-100 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-rose-800">EN VIVO · DEMO</span><span class="text-sm text-slate-500">{auction.ends?`${auction.ends}s restantes`:'Finalizada'}</span></div><h2 class="mt-4 text-xl">{auction.name}</h2><p class="text-sm text-slate-600">{auction.lot} · {auction.department}</p><p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">Oferta actual simulada</p><p class="text-3xl font-extrabold">S/ {auction.bid.toLocaleString('es-PE')}</p><button disabled={!auction.ends} onclick={()=>bid(auction.id)}>Ofertar + S/ 100</button></article>{/each}</section>
    {:else if active==='ubicacion'}
